            "level": {
              "value": 8
            },
            "description": {
              "value": "When you observe an ally try and fail to execute a strategic maneuver against your enemies, you coordinate with your other allies to finish the job, using the opening from the first attempt to keep your foe off-balance and ensure your eventual success.\n\nWhen an ally within your overwatch field attempts to Disarm, Shove, or Trip an opponent within your overwatch field and fails, you coordinate efforts to provide a +2 circumstance bonus to the next Athletics check rolled by a different ally to attempt the same action on the same target before that target's next turn."
            }
